  "description": "The Warp 11 step-through debugger, as a component. Watch any signal at any hierarchy depth, poke inputs, page through memories, set breakpoints written as expressions over your own signal names, read a per-cycle waveform, export VCD. Platform-neutral (Avalonia + FuncUI) so the same debugger runs on the desktop and in a browser; reference Warp11.SimView.Desktop for a desktop application.",
